EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Well, I did ask out of the blue,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} so
I guess I shouldn't be surprised.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Let's do it some other time!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Beh, te l'ho chiesto così, un po'
all'improvviso, quindi è normale!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Facciamo{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} un'altra volta!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Birdenbire sordum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} o yüzden
şaşırmamam gerek.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Başka zaman yapalım!
